    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), unless this unit is currently **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**, you can roll a D6 for it as a **[psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)**, and then:\n\n- on a 1, the unit becomes **battle-shocked**\n- pick 1 **visible** enemy unit up to 18\" from this unit; it is **suppressed** until your next turn\n\nA **suppressed** unit's attacks get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
